  "question": "实带通信号 s(t)=A(t)cos(2πf_c t+φ(t))，解析信号 z(t)=s(t)+jŝ(t)。若 A(t)=2、φ(t)=0，写出 z(t) 并求复包络 a(t) 使 s(t)=Re{a(t)e^{j2πf_c t}}。",
  "answer": "z(t)=2e^{j2πf_c t}；a(t)=2（常数复包络）。",
  "techniques": [
    "解析信号定义",
    "复包络提取",
    "实部还原"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "s1",
        "text": "A(t)=2、φ=0 时 s(t)=2cos(2πf_c t)，希尔伯特项 ŝ(t)=2sin(2πf_c t)"
      },
      {
        "id": "s2",
        "text": "z(t)=2(cos+j sin)=2e^{j2πf_c t}"
      },
      {
        "id": "s3",
        "text": "对比 s=Re{a e^{j2πf_c t}} 得 a(t)=2。"
      }
    ],
    "final_answer": "z(t)=2e^{j2πf_c t}；a(t)=2（常数复包络）。",
